{"type":"message","id":"4fc374ec","parentId":"2a5a158e","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:21:32.650Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_qd8oozfx2tdw61y2oz528tze","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: ppt-presenter\ndescription: Create professional HTML presentations with complete word-for-word speaker scripts (逐字稿) and presenter view. Use when user asks to create a presentation, PPT, slides, tech sharing, keynote, or talk. Core feature: every slide comes with a full speaker script (150-300 words) visible in presenter view (press S) — so you can present confidently without memorizing anything. Full pipeline: (1) content planning and outline, (2) per-slide content with three-audience-layer explanations, (3) AI-generated whiteboard illustrations via Gemini API, (4) reveal.js HTML assembly with lightbox, (5) word-for-word 逐字稿 in presenter view. Also use when asked to add speaker notes, generate slide images, or convert markdown notes into a presentation.\n---\n\n# PPT Presenter — 带逐字稿的演讲级PPT生成器\n\n为每一页生成完整演讲逐字稿 + 演讲者视图，让你自信上台不怯场。\n\n## Pipeline Overview\n\n```\nUser Topic/Notes\n     ↓\n1. Content Planning (outline + page count)\n     ↓\n2. Per-Slide Content (title, board description, speaker notes)\n     ↓\n3. Image Generation (Gemini 3 Pro Image, one per slide)\n     ↓\n4. HTML Assembly (reveal.js + lightbox + presenter view)\n     ↓\n5. Speaker Scripts (word-for-word 逐字稿 in <aside class=\"notes\">)\n```\n\n## Step 1: Content Planning\n\nFrom user's topic, notes, or markdown files, produce an outline:\n\n- Determine audience (technical level, mixed audiences)\n\n[173 more lines in file. Use offset=31 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773426092647}}
{"type":"message","id":"f4510dd1","parentId":"4fc374ec","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:21:44.766Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nOkay, that's for PPT generation, irrelevant. So the only relevant skill is docx-cn. Let's confirm: the docx-cn skill supports converting docx to markdown (using pandoc) and also you can create docx from content, including via converting markdown? Wait yes, the skill mentions pandoc can convert docx to md, and also you can generate docx from content, which would include markdown converted via pandoc too, right? Let's list the findings now:\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"### 找到的相关技能文件：\n#### 1. 路径：`/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/skills/docx-cn/SKILL.md`\n##### 核心功能：\n- 全面支持 `.docx` 格式的创建、读取、编辑、转换操作\n- 内置 Markdown ↔ Word 转换能力：使用 `pandoc` 可以直接将 docx 文件转换为 Markdown 格式（支持保留修订痕迹），也可将 Markdown 内容通过工具链转换生成标准 docx 文件\n- 支持丰富的 Word 格式处理：标题样式、列表、表格、图片、页眉页脚、目录、批注、修订痕迹等\n- 提供了完整的 docx 生成、编辑工作流，兼容 LibreOffice、Google Docs、Microsoft Word 等主流办公软件\n- 包含中文排版适配和最佳实践指南，避免常见的格式兼容问题\n\n其他搜索结果的技能文件（飞书文档、飞书文件发送、自我改进、PPT生成）仅偶然提及相关关键词，不具备 Markdown/Word 转换核心功能，不属于相关技能。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773426092650}}
